s=3D"react-directory-commit-message"><a data-pjax=3D"true" title=3D"Fix Mon=
go/Postgres unbounded graph traversals and sync UI query docs

- mongo_queries_repository.rs: replace $graphLookup with a bounded,
  self-deduplicating hop-by-hop traversal (bounded_traversal_stages /
  bounded_traversal_stages_with_edge_filter) to fix combinatorial memory
  blowups on hub vertices. Adds MONGO_GRAPH_FANOUT_CAP env knob.
- mongo_client.rs: enable allowDiskUse on aggregations.
- cli.rs/main.rs: add debug-mongo-queries command.
- postgres_queries_repository.rs: rewrite aggregate_expansion_3/4[_with_fil=
ter],
  pattern_long, and all_shortest_paths_len as bounded recursive CTEs
  (UNION-deduped per (id, depth), LIMIT-capped fan-out) instead of plain
  N-way self-joins / path-array CTEs. Adds POSTGRES_GRAPH_FANOUT_CAP env
  knob.
- postgres_client.rs: refactor into a connection pool for multi-core
  parallelism.
- main.rs: fix coordinated-omission latency skew in Falkor/Neo4j/Memgraph
  workers by measuring duration from actual dequeue time instead of the
  scheduler's intended start time.
- scripts: add MONGO_QUERY_TIMEOUT_MS/MONGO_GRAPH_FANOUT_CAP/
  POSTGRES_GRAPH_FANOUT_CAP knobs to run_medium_benchmark.sh and
  run_large_benchmark.sh.
- ui/dashboard.tsx: show the run-history selector on the multi-engine page
  and make single-workload charts respect the Vendors filter.
- ui/SidebarNavigation.tsx: sync &quot;Query Explanations &amp; Samples&quo=
t; sample text
  with the rewritten Mongo/Postgres queries and add an &quot;open in new ta=
b&quot;
  button.
- ui/public/summaries: add latest benchmark run snapshots.

