<p dir=3D"auto">This benchmark provides comprehensive performance compariso=
ns between FalkorDB and Neo4j graph databases. This benchmark
specifically focuses on aggregate expansion operations, a common workload i=
n graph database applications. The results
indicate FalkorDB's particular strength in maintaining consistent performan=
ce under varying workload conditions,
especially crucial for production environments where predictable response t=
imes are essential.</p>
